 "subject": "feat(email-to-pdf): add inline images, clickable links, and embedded attachments - Add CID inline image support via base64 data URI replacement - Implement clickable link extraction from HTML anchors using regex - Embed email attachments into PDF using pymupdf embfile_add - Reduce font sizes for more compact PDF output (18px subject, 12px body) - Format date with timezone (UTC+HH:MM) while preserving original time - Clean email address formatting (Name (email) instead of <brackets>) - Add UI options: page size selector, CC/BCC toggle, attachments toggle",
